# cisco_ios_show_interfaces_status.textfsm
# 自定义版本：兼容性增强，移除 ^. -> Error 规则，允许跳过不认识的行
# 原内置模板在遇到 "Load for..." / 时间戳行 / 非标准格式行时会触发 State Error
# 本版本改为静默跳过，保留所有字段定义与匹配规则不变

Value PORT (\S+)
Value NAME (.+?)
Value STATUS (err-disabled|disabled|connected|notconnect|inactive|up|down|monitoring|suspended)
Value VLAN_ID (\d+(,\d+)*|trunk|routed|unassigned|pvlan\s+prom)
Value DUPLEX (\S+)
Value SPEED (\S+)
Value TYPE (.*)
Value FC_MODE (\S+)

Start
  ^Load\s+for\s+
  ^Time\s+source\s+is
  ^-+\s*$$
  ^Port\s+Name\s+Status\s+Vlan\s+Duplex\s+Speed\s+Type -> Interfaces
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Continue

Interfaces
  # FC port format: "Gi0/1 is connected Port mode is ..."
  ^\s*${PORT}\s+is\s+${STATUS}\s+Port\s+mode\s+is\s+${FC_MODE}\s*$$ -> Record
  # Short format: "Gi0/1 is connected (err-disabled)"
  ^\s*${PORT}\s+is\s+${STATUS}\s+\(${TYPE}\)\s*$$ -> Record
  # No-name format: "Gi0/1  connected  1  a-full  a-100  10/100BaseTX"
  ^\s*${PORT}\s+${STATUS}\s+${VLAN_ID}\s+${DUPLEX}\s+${SPEED}\s*${TYPE}$$ -> Record
  # Full format with name: "Gi0/1  myport  connected  1  a-full  a-100  10/100BaseTX"
  ^\s*${PORT}\s+${NAME}\s+${STATUS}:?(\s+\S+)?\s+${VLAN_ID}\s+${DUPLEX}\s+${SPEED}\s*${TYPE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^-+
  ^\s*$$
  # 跳过所有不匹配的行（原内置模板此处为 ^. -> Error，会导致 State Error）
  ^.
